296
00:17:00,937 --> 00:17:03,523
Vaya, Priyanka.

297
00:17:03,689 --> 00:17:05,441
Si no te conociera...

298
00:17:06,150 --> 00:17:07,735
Pero, C.H., me conoces.

299
00:17:08,778 --> 00:17:10,404
Me conoces.

300
00:17:10,821 --> 00:17:15,785
Así que... llegamos a la cabaña.
Una pocilga.

301
00:17:15,952 --> 00:17:18,746
Gina esperó en el coche.
La puerta estaba abierta.

302
00:17:18,871 --> 00:17:20,289
Entré.

303
00:17:20,456 --> 00:17:22,333
Estaba sentado ahí frente al fuego.

304
00:17:22,500 --> 00:17:25,628
Dije: "Buenas, Medusa.

305
00:17:25,795 --> 00:17:28,172
Maeve Harrigan te manda saludos".

306
00:17:28,339 --> 00:17:30,841
Se volteó y dijo: "¿Maeve?".

307
00:17:31,008 --> 00:17:33,427
Dije: "Sí, me oíste. Maeve".

308
00:17:34,178 --> 00:17:37,265
Y de pronto puso cierta mirada,

309
00:17:37,431 --> 00:17:39,183
y tartamudeó:

310
00:17:39,350 --> 00:17:43,271
"No, no Maeve Harrigan".

311
00:17:43,437 --> 00:17:44,564
Y asentí como:

312
00:17:44,730 --> 00:17:47,024
"Sí, amigo. Créelo".

313
00:17:48,776 --> 00:17:51,237
Y apunto,

314
00:17:51,404 --> 00:17:52,947
y se pone de rodillas...

315
00:17:53,990 --> 00:17:55,199
