452
00:26:48,690 --> 00:26:51,360
Hola, Donnie.
Soy Frankie Cooper. Escucha,

453
00:26:51,527 --> 00:26:53,028
<i>esto es supersimple.</i>

454
00:26:53,195 --> 00:26:56,281
O me entregas a esta perra hoy,

455
00:26:56,448 --> 00:26:57,741
